WEBVTT

00:00.580 --> 00:01.500
It happened.

00:02.180 --> 00:03.150
Samatarou's...

00:04.370 --> 00:05.370
With Samatarou...

00:06.400 --> 00:07.180
I...

00:11.760 --> 00:13.470
Do not disturb!!

00:16.360 --> 00:17.950
We made a baby!

00:22.740 --> 00:24.350
Tenko? Are you there?

00:34.370 --> 00:35.740
Ow...

00:36.340 --> 00:36.770
Hm?

00:40.980 --> 00:43.460
What's wrong, Tenko? Something happen?

00:48.980 --> 00:52.140
What should we do? We're gonna be in so much trouble!

00:52.220 --> 00:55.900
What? You don't have to cry. Just tell me what's wrong!

00:59.930 --> 01:01.040
Well...

01:05.850 --> 01:08.270
No, I can't tell you!

01:11.190 --> 01:13.890
Tell me! Whatever you say isn't going to surprise me.

01:14.020 --> 01:14.820
Really?

01:14.950 --> 01:15.450
Yeah.

01:15.800 --> 01:18.700
Seriously? I can believe you?

01:19.460 --> 01:20.680
Of course.

01:24.510 --> 01:25.880
It... came out.

01:26.950 --> 01:28.410
Came out? What did?

01:28.410 --> 01:29.800
No!

01:30.890 --> 01:32.830
We made a...

01:34.130 --> 01:34.850
A baby.

01:38.830 --> 01:41.080
Who's the guy? Someone I know?

01:42.860 --> 01:44.430
That "someone" is you!

01:45.500 --> 01:48.220
I... I'm the father?

01:51.160 --> 01:51.590
Yeah.

01:57.270 --> 02:01.650
Kamiyama Samatarou, high school freshman, will be a father starting today.

02:21.700 --> 02:27.020
dare mo shiranai basho de

02:21.700 --> 02:27.020
In a place unknown to everyone

02:27.840 --> 02:32.700
asa ga umare hajimeru

02:27.840 --> 02:32.700
The dawn is being born

02:33.060 --> 02:39.140
hoshi inotta negai wo ima wa

02:33.060 --> 02:39.140
The wishes you made upon a star

02:39.140 --> 02:45.040
hikari wo naku shita no ue ni koborete iru

02:39.140 --> 02:45.040
Are spilling forth from where the light had vanished

02:45.340 --> 02:53.950
sotto sukuu tame ni te wo nobasu

02:45.340 --> 02:53.950
I softly extend my hand to rescue you

02:57.140 --> 03:00.270
boku no koe wa sekai wo koete

02:57.140 --> 03:00.270
And my voice envelops the entire world

03:00.290 --> 03:03.360
itsu ka kimi ni tadoritsuku darou

03:00.290 --> 03:03.360
Perhaps some day it will struggle its way to you

03:03.380 --> 03:06.290
toiki morashi yume ga oitemo

03:03.380 --> 03:06.290
Even if you must abandon your dreams, exhale deeply

03:06.540 --> 03:09.430
douka kesshite wasurenu you ni

03:06.540 --> 03:09.430
And you'll never really lose them

03:09.430 --> 03:12.510
boku no yubi ga subete ni fureru

03:09.430 --> 03:12.510
My fingers touch all of creation

03:12.510 --> 03:17.900
tobira akete haruka kanata e

03:12.510 --> 03:17.900
Open the door and escape to a distant place

03:36.460 --> 03:40.050
Dialog Translation: rabidkimba; Everything else: Chikushou

03:36.460 --> 03:40.460
Tenko's Baby

03:56.120 --> 03:58.380
Bubbles, bubbles~ Washy, washy~

04:07.620 --> 04:11.210
Note: The notes are being read verbatim, so they will not be typeset.

04:07.620 --> 04:09.010
The Door to Heaven

04:09.210 --> 04:10.160
Don't open it*

04:10.400 --> 04:11.210
-Papa

04:31.190 --> 04:32.910
Papa's workplace

04:33.280 --> 04:35.880
Other than times of EMERGENCY, entry prohibited.

04:36.090 --> 04:38.510
Mama is an exception. Because I like her.

04:38.710 --> 04:39.660
-Papa

05:02.810 --> 05:03.610
Meme?

05:05.000 --> 05:06.010
What's wrong?

05:06.140 --> 05:07.200
Did you come all by yourself?

05:09.120 --> 05:10.860
Thank you very much.

05:11.120 --> 05:12.060
Hm? What for?

05:13.120 --> 05:16.590
You made what I wished for come true.

05:17.870 --> 05:19.630
Oh yeah, I got that one.

05:20.590 --> 05:25.690
"Recently, Samatarou and Tenko have been unfriendly towards each other, so please do something about it", right?

05:26.860 --> 05:28.840
Papa hasn't done anything about that one yet.

05:29.130 --> 05:33.150
What? But Bro and Tenko were hugging.

05:33.150 --> 05:35.180
They probably made up on their own.

05:35.180 --> 05:36.920
That's good, Meme.

05:37.510 --> 05:38.070
Yeah.

05:38.470 --> 05:41.120
But you know, I was surprised!

05:41.250 --> 05:43.390
You came so suddenly!

05:43.390 --> 05:44.410
I'm sorry.

05:44.560 --> 05:46.590
Oh, I'm not angry or anything!

05:47.090 --> 05:50.220
I just didn't think knew how to get here...

05:50.350 --> 05:52.640
Oh, but you can come up and play any time!

05:52.810 --> 05:54.620
You can come five times a week!

05:55.600 --> 05:57.080
That's too much.

05:57.210 --> 06:00.080
Oh? Am I too much for you?

06:03.720 --> 06:05.920
Hey Papa, what were you doing?

06:05.920 --> 06:08.270
Oh, just a little fishing.

06:11.640 --> 06:13.150
This is the Amanogawa.

06:11.640 --> 06:13.150
Note: "Amanogawa" can either be "Milky Way" or "River of Fishing"

06:13.500 --> 06:15.410
Do you know about Tanabata?

06:13.500 --> 06:15.410
Note: Tanabata is a festival in July, during which people place wishes on pieces of paper and hang them on trees or special walls.

06:20.880 --> 06:22.160
What's that?

06:22.970 --> 06:23.810
Oh, wait one second.

06:36.420 --> 06:37.940
I want to become a rock star.

06:38.550 --> 06:40.710
Okay, let's make you one.

06:41.280 --> 06:47.610
You see, these are wishes that have been sent with all of someone's heart for two months.

06:48.130 --> 06:49.090
Wow...

06:53.030 --> 06:54.140
Oops!

06:54.140 --> 06:56.990
Darn... the wish I granted went somewhere else...

06:57.320 --> 06:57.860
Maybe.

06:58.260 --> 06:59.130
I'm sorry.

07:01.060 --> 07:03.590
Oh well. I did that yesterday, too.

07:04.810 --> 07:07.330
Was I a bad girl after all?

07:07.550 --> 07:10.670
No, no, no, no! No.

07:11.080 --> 07:15.740
You're a good girl, thinking about Samatarou and Tenko.

07:20.400 --> 07:22.510
You've sure grown up, Meme!

07:22.990 --> 07:25.170
Of course. I'm a lady.

07:31.280 --> 07:32.550
Why are you getting mad?

07:32.550 --> 07:34.940
I'm only telling the truth!

07:35.460 --> 07:36.550
Okay, Tenko.

07:36.550 --> 07:38.340
Tell me from the beginning.

07:38.680 --> 07:40.950
Why did you think I was the father?

07:42.520 --> 07:45.830
B-because I... I've only...

07:46.220 --> 07:48.920
I've only kissed you before!

07:51.400 --> 07:56.970
Earlier, Meme was asking Papa how babies were made.

07:57.820 --> 07:58.470
And then...?

08:00.150 --> 08:05.250
He said "When a boy and a girl kiss, mister stork comes".

08:06.200 --> 08:07.250
...And then?

08:07.710 --> 08:11.890
And then earlier today, I went to pick up the newspaper before everyone woke up!

08:30.670 --> 08:32.940
A... a baby?

08:34.290 --> 08:35.960
Please take responsibility for it, Papa!

08:35.960 --> 08:37.140
I won't!

08:38.490 --> 08:40.600
Hey, just listen to me!

08:40.620 --> 08:41.690
What, Papa?

08:44.870 --> 08:46.630
I'M NOT THE PAPA!

08:46.740 --> 08:49.920
Okay, first of all, babies aren't made because of kisses!

08:49.940 --> 08:51.310
GAAAN

08:51.490 --> 08:53.660
Don't go "GAAAAAN" when you're surprised like that!

08:54.010 --> 08:56.520
What are you, some character in a 70s comedy?!

08:56.730 --> 08:58.820
Then how are babies made?

09:03.350 --> 09:04.140
Number two.

09:04.140 --> 09:05.250
Why are you avoiding it?

09:05.250 --> 09:08.600
Shut up! "Babies are delivered by storks"?

09:08.600 --> 09:09.490
That's a superstition!

09:09.560 --> 09:10.490
GABII-N

09:10.800 --> 09:12.280
Don't say "GABII-N"!

09:12.280 --> 09:13.980
Then, how about that baby?

09:16.980 --> 09:19.290
Maybe it's an abandoned child...

09:19.830 --> 09:22.710
There might be some clues around here.

09:23.840 --> 09:25.800
This child will probably become beautiful!

09:26.120 --> 09:27.540
So it's a girl?

09:27.670 --> 09:30.350
Yeah, I changed her diaper, so there's no mistaking it.

09:32.480 --> 09:34.440
Hm? What's this?

09:37.880 --> 09:39.800
"It'd be nice to meet again".

09:40.080 --> 09:40.800
-"Ai"

09:41.410 --> 09:43.760
Her mother must have written this.

09:44.040 --> 09:45.890
Isn't it an abandoned child, after all?

09:46.070 --> 09:48.240
Abandoned? Even though she's this cute?

09:49.240 --> 09:49.790
Huh?

09:49.920 --> 09:50.290
Hm?

09:51.090 --> 09:53.770
Doesn't she have more hair than she did just a few minutes ago?

09:54.230 --> 09:56.190
Isn't that just part growing up?

10:01.960 --> 10:03.920
Who is this?

10:04.310 --> 10:07.030
So, your name is Ai-chan?

10:07.400 --> 10:09.600
You know, she doesn't understand words yet.

10:09.840 --> 10:10.930
Ai-chan.

10:14.780 --> 10:15.630
She spoke?

10:16.260 --> 10:17.980
Cause she's... growing up?

10:20.490 --> 10:24.010
Anyway, Tenko, we need to return her to her mother.

10:24.100 --> 10:25.340
I'm the mother.

10:26.040 --> 10:27.650
I'm not the father.

10:28.540 --> 10:30.280
Anyway, let's give her to the police.

10:32.310 --> 10:33.720
What if they never find her Mom?

10:34.140 --> 10:35.790
Then she'll be an orphan!

10:36.290 --> 10:37.580
That'd be terrible!

10:39.010 --> 10:42.560
And anyway, I don't want to return her to anyone that would throw a child this cute away.

10:42.890 --> 10:43.520
Hey.

10:43.910 --> 10:46.850
Ai-chan, you'd rather be with Tenko-mama, right?

10:47.180 --> 10:48.130
Mama!

10:48.570 --> 10:49.850
This is your Papa!

10:49.850 --> 10:51.600
I'm not a Papa!

10:52.010 --> 10:52.770
Papa!

10:59.130 --> 11:00.890
She's so cute...

11:08.600 --> 11:10.670
Um... may I?

11:12.890 --> 11:17.110
Oh, I knocked, but there wasn't any answer.

11:20.940 --> 11:21.750
Oh, um...

11:21.940 --> 11:23.430
I'm Kirishima Shinichi.

11:23.730 --> 11:30.220
Um, well, I was in the middle of trying to make a nest for little birds to live in, when I suddenly fell out of a tree.

11:32.630 --> 11:37.580
Then I was hospitalized, and noticed you in the courtyard.

11:38.250 --> 11:40.750
I thought, "I'd really like to become friends with her".

11:41.230 --> 11:42.020
Friends?

11:42.320 --> 11:43.520
That's right! Friends!

11:44.220 --> 11:45.260
What's your name?

11:45.760 --> 11:47.900
I don't need... friends.

11:49.110 --> 11:51.140
Oh, crap! I'm sorry for interrupting you at this hour.

11:51.470 --> 11:52.660
I'll see you tomorrow!

11:54.510 --> 11:55.430
What's wrong?

11:56.820 --> 11:57.950
What happened?

12:04.700 --> 12:06.400
At least answer me.

12:32.960 --> 12:38.510
Now, Samatarou, eat up and get a lot of energy so you can grow up to become a great god!

12:45.370 --> 12:47.330
Hey, Samacchin, did something happen?

12:48.310 --> 12:50.530
Nothing's wrong. Right, Tenko?

12:50.680 --> 12:51.420
WHAT?

12:51.530 --> 12:53.690
YEAH, NOTHING'S WRONG!

12:58.780 --> 13:01.000
Anyway, I'm going to eat dinner in my room tonight!

13:01.110 --> 13:01.890
Me too!

13:02.330 --> 13:03.790
What's wrong with you two?

13:03.790 --> 13:05.600
Do you hate this family so much?

13:06.030 --> 13:07.400
This must be what they call puberty.

13:07.400 --> 13:09.560
This must be what they call a "rebellious stage"!

13:10.620 --> 13:16.090
Okay! Look, Mama is naked in an apron!

13:15.070 --> 13:16.020
Okay, okay.

13:17.830 --> 13:20.310
Tenko, aren't you going to scold me?

13:20.310 --> 13:23.210
Mama's a clown. A sad, sad clown!

13:24.910 --> 13:26.060
Thanks for the food.

13:29.240 --> 13:33.050
Did Mama make too many jokes and get hated?

13:34.810 --> 13:35.730
Shouldn't you put on some clothes?

13:39.730 --> 13:41.170
Okay, open wide!

13:45.830 --> 13:47.460
Papa, seconds!

13:48.770 --> 13:50.880
It's really tough raising a kid.

13:51.380 --> 13:53.750
Samatarou, you're going to become a father one day, right?

13:54.230 --> 13:55.390
This is practice for that!

13:56.100 --> 13:58.670
But doesn't the wife do stuff like that?

13:58.890 --> 14:01.200
Raising a kid all on my own is really tough!

14:01.660 --> 14:03.530
You're going to help out, too.

14:04.010 --> 14:06.530
No one was talking about you, though...

14:06.950 --> 14:08.190
We're talking about my wife.

14:08.620 --> 14:08.860
Right?

14:09.040 --> 14:09.560
Eh?!

14:13.720 --> 14:18.660
Well this is if I was your wife in some hypothetical...

14:21.180 --> 14:22.510
Okay, Ai-chan.

14:22.790 --> 14:24.300
Are you ready for your breast feeding?

14:25.970 --> 14:28.060
What? I'm talking about regular milk!

14:28.060 --> 14:30.060
I'm just trying to sound like a mother!

14:30.200 --> 14:31.850
Hurry up and get some milk!

14:31.850 --> 14:33.180
Okay, I got it.

14:34.770 --> 14:35.140
Ow.

14:41.580 --> 14:43.190
I saw it!

14:43.190 --> 14:46.180
Now, now, I won't be telling anyone else.

14:46.810 --> 14:48.790
I'll just stay quiet.

14:50.440 --> 14:52.900
Be friendly with each other so you don't scar the baby, okay?

14:53.320 --> 14:56.340
Our secret just got leaked to someone dangerous...

15:02.900 --> 15:06.080
If she cares about the baby so much, why don't they sleep together?

15:06.080 --> 15:07.250
Jeez, that Tenko.

15:21.230 --> 15:22.400
Well, I guess it's fine.

15:31.900 --> 15:33.680
Papa, give me a hug!

15:35.490 --> 15:37.560
Papa, hold me tighter!

15:39.520 --> 15:41.740
Yeah. Now I feel safe.

15:41.930 --> 15:42.870
Wha?

15:55.670 --> 15:57.780
Samatarou, is something wrong with Ai-chan?

16:02.550 --> 16:03.490
Who?

16:03.490 --> 16:04.200
Mama!

16:05.490 --> 16:06.860
Ai-chan?

16:07.400 --> 16:08.210
Yeah.

16:08.210 --> 16:09.580
Papa is scary.

16:10.020 --> 16:11.910
He yells.

16:12.370 --> 16:13.350
It's okay.

16:13.650 --> 16:15.810
He was just a little sleepy.

16:16.440 --> 16:18.880
Hey, you guys are a little loud-

16:30.960 --> 16:33.750
This is Papa's sister, Misa.

16:33.750 --> 16:34.920
Okay, say hello!

16:34.920 --> 16:36.920
Nice to meet you! My name's Ai!

16:37.100 --> 16:39.520
I'm Misa, nice to meet you...

16:41.560 --> 16:42.220
What's wrong?

16:42.450 --> 16:44.220
Well, um...

16:47.480 --> 16:49.140
I wet the bed.

16:58.150 --> 16:59.940
It's fine, Ai-chan.

17:00.180 --> 17:01.940
C'mon, let's get in the bath.

17:01.940 --> 17:02.590
'Kay!

17:10.840 --> 17:14.610
Um, Ai-chan, this is Papa's little sister, Meme.

17:15.310 --> 17:16.610
I'm Ai.

17:17.090 --> 17:18.860
Um, she's...

17:19.230 --> 17:20.070
Don't worry about it.

17:20.320 --> 17:22.190
It seems like it would take awhile to explain.

17:22.340 --> 17:23.410
Tell me later.

17:24.760 --> 17:29.720
Meme, are you taking a bath, too? Let's get in together! C'mon!

17:30.850 --> 17:33.270
Meme, can you go in with her?

17:33.490 --> 17:34.330
Yeah.

17:35.050 --> 17:37.910
Okay, Mama is going to go talk to Papa for a little bit.

17:38.100 --> 17:38.990
'Kay!

17:43.630 --> 17:45.590
Count to ten, okay?

17:45.740 --> 17:46.180
'Kay!

17:51.230 --> 17:53.120
I don't know anymore!

17:53.180 --> 17:55.420
When I saw it yesterday it was just a baby!

17:55.630 --> 17:58.580
Why has she already grown up to a kindergartener's age?

17:59.310 --> 18:02.920
Samatarou, Tenko, take responsibility.

18:03.160 --> 18:05.180
I don't know, either...

18:05.490 --> 18:07.320
If you don't know. find out!

18:07.360 --> 18:08.820
Find out somehow!

18:08.820 --> 18:09.930
That's...!

18:10.100 --> 18:11.690
Hey! You're the bad one here!

18:11.690 --> 18:13.370
How mean! You're the Papa, after all!

18:13.370 --> 18:16.220
I'm not the Papa. There's no way!

18:17.400 --> 18:19.810
I want to get a divorce from this man!

18:19.970 --> 18:21.880
We're not married!

18:22.970 --> 18:23.880
Do whatever you want!

18:24.190 --> 18:26.370
You two work this out.

18:26.370 --> 18:29.680
Well, I'm going back to sleep, so don't bother me!

18:32.440 --> 18:34.380
WHAT'S THIS VOICE?

18:38.320 --> 18:41.020
Mama! Bring me some clothes!

18:41.870 --> 18:45.720
I can hear the voice of an enchantress!

18:48.310 --> 18:51.290
Samatarou! If Mama finds out, she'll panic!

18:51.290 --> 18:52.210
I got it!

18:55.740 --> 18:57.150
It's just your imagination!

18:57.150 --> 18:59.310
We can't hear that, right?

18:59.500 --> 19:01.110
Not at all, right?

19:02.010 --> 19:04.100
Mama, hurry up!

19:06.530 --> 19:09.580
It's calling my name!

19:10.310 --> 19:11.030
This is bad!

19:11.120 --> 19:12.350
Hurry up and deceive her!

19:12.350 --> 19:13.690
How do I do that?

19:14.000 --> 19:15.610
It's calling for me! An enchantress!

19:15.610 --> 19:16.180
That's right!

19:18.750 --> 19:22.140
Mama, I heard that hearing things is bad for your skin!

19:23.340 --> 19:24.670
Really?

19:25.650 --> 19:26.390
Yeah!

19:31.530 --> 19:32.830
Mama is going back to sleep.

19:32.830 --> 19:34.710
Maybe two or three more times!

19:43.090 --> 19:44.520
It's a little big.

19:44.870 --> 19:46.920
Yeah! So baggy!

19:54.890 --> 19:56.080
I'm coming in!

20:08.490 --> 20:10.300
You're always looking outside, aren't you?

20:10.780 --> 20:14.390
What, could you be a member of the Japanese bird watching club?

20:14.500 --> 20:16.900
Could you be looking for UFOs?

20:17.770 --> 20:18.900
Could it be...

20:19.810 --> 20:22.170
You're not thinking of anything crazy, are you?

20:22.860 --> 20:23.910
I could be...

20:26.560 --> 20:29.850
In my dreams, the devil appears.

20:31.090 --> 20:37.320
A beautiful woman... she waves her hand and tells me to "come this way".

20:38.020 --> 20:39.910
But no matter what, I can't.

20:39.910 --> 20:40.670
Why not?

20:42.630 --> 20:43.570
Because she's waiting.

20:43.850 --> 20:45.900
Waiting? Who is?

20:48.990 --> 20:50.080
You're some skirt-chaser, right?

20:50.340 --> 20:51.190
You must be an idiot.

20:52.780 --> 20:54.650
I'll come again later!

20:58.610 --> 20:59.550
Really...

21:01.660 --> 21:02.830
Such an idiot.

21:05.320 --> 21:07.300
Okay, Ai, now's your chance!

21:07.490 --> 21:07.800
'Kay!

21:11.430 --> 21:14.590
Man, even going to the bathroom is a pain.

21:15.050 --> 21:17.750
Mama's getting a change of clothes right now, okay?

21:18.120 --> 21:19.120
Hey, Papa!

21:19.270 --> 21:19.660
Hm?

21:20.250 --> 21:23.410
I can only be here for five!

21:24.540 --> 21:26.800
In my dreams, someone was telling me.

21:27.200 --> 21:29.370
They say not to forget that!

21:29.530 --> 21:31.700
So she says to hurry up and do it!

21:32.030 --> 21:35.100
Five... as in the number five?

21:38.800 --> 21:39.450
Yeah!

21:40.800 --> 21:41.930
Five days!

21:42.090 --> 21:43.110
Note: Ai is made an error. Days are counted differently. Can't blame the girl.

21:46.110 --> 21:48.710
There it is! The enchantress!

21:48.710 --> 21:49.750
Ma...

21:50.450 --> 21:51.140
Who is that?

21:51.580 --> 21:52.650
Papa's mama.

21:52.650 --> 21:54.760
What? Hallucinations again?

21:54.760 --> 21:57.590
What have I done to deserve this?!

21:57.610 --> 21:59.610
No, this is...

22:04.160 --> 22:04.970
I'm Ai!

22:04.970 --> 22:07.210
Hello, gramma!

22:07.210 --> 22:10.210
Gramma... me...?

22:10.520 --> 22:13.310
Nooooooo!

22:16.380 --> 22:19.080
What? A real girl?

22:23.390 --> 22:24.410
Busted.

22:40.200 --> 22:45.690
aru asa totsuzen (uh huh) sekai ga kawattete (kawattete)

22:40.200 --> 22:45.690
The world suddenly changed one morning

22:46.560 --> 22:52.150
kaeri no tochuu de (uh huh) kimi ni kissu sareru no (sareru no)

22:46.560 --> 22:52.150
While we were on the way home, you unexpectedly kissed me

22:52.560 --> 22:56.540
sonna no aru wake nai ka

22:52.560 --> 22:56.540
I doubt something like that would ever happen though

22:59.400 --> 23:04.140
dakara atashi kara ippo fumidasu kedo

22:59.400 --> 23:04.140
That's why my shoulders sank when you stepped away from me

23:05.650 --> 23:10.840
suki na taipu kiite kata wo otoshita

23:05.650 --> 23:10.840
And told me about the kinda girls you like

23:11.080 --> 23:17.430
atama ni doonatsu wo nosete mitemo

23:11.080 --> 23:17.430
Even if you put a doughnut over your head

23:18.310 --> 23:24.550
kore dake ja tenshi ni mienai (nainai kana)

23:18.310 --> 23:24.550
It wouldn't be enough to make you look like an angel!

23:25.820 --> 23:31.770
o~o kamisama onegai (kamisama onegai) kiru sugita maegami

23:25.820 --> 23:31.770
Oh please, God! Allow the bangs I cut too short

23:31.770 --> 23:37.500
sugu modoshitai nanto ka shiteyo

23:31.770 --> 23:37.500
To grow back quickly! You can do it somehow

23:37.530 --> 23:39.380
kotaenasai

23:37.530 --> 23:39.380
Please answer my prayer!

23:39.410 --> 23:47.190
sore ja naykkya ano wanpiisu ga niaeba

23:39.410 --> 23:47.190
Or at least let that one piece look good on me

23:47.230 --> 23:52.360
subete wa umaku iku yo, tabun

23:47.230 --> 23:52.360
Then everything will turn out okay... probably!

24:04.120 --> 24:05.840
Mama, please calm down!

24:05.840 --> 24:07.990
Okay, well I'm going to go see how Shinichi is doing!

24:07.990 --> 24:10.260
Who is that wheelchair girl and what are you doing with her?

24:10.370 --> 24:12.220
I think I've met you somewhere before...

24:12.390 --> 24:14.220
I have that feeling, too...

24:14.290 --> 24:15.640
In a dream?

24:15.640 --> 24:18.090
There's no way... all of my dreams are...

24:18.140 --> 24:20.470
Samatarou! Ai-chan is gone!

24:21.230 --> 24:24.170
Next time on Kamisama Kazoku: A Growing Girl

24:24.470 --> 24:27.280
Hey, you... A-AI?
